B.IZ=new A.eV("prayer","The prayer","Prayer is at set times. In the mosque, follow the imam. People are usually taught these fard units: Fajr 2, Dhuhr 4, Asr 4, Maghrib 3, Isha 4. That count is the common teaching. It is not this verse. Extra sunnah units differ. Follow this mosque.",null,B.a0_,null)
B.Zz=s(["5:6"],t.s)
B.IX=new A.eV("wudu","Washing before prayer","The Quran names the wash: the face, the arms to the elbows, a wipe of the head, and the feet to the ankles. A cast, or no water, is for the imam \u2014 not this page.",null,B.Zz,null)
B.a2b=s(["2:43"],t.s)
B.IN=new A.eV("zakat","Zakat","Zakat is a required share of qualifying wealth, not a tip. Many people give 2.5% of cash and gold after a lunar year, once they are above the nisab. That rate is the common teaching. It is not this verse. This app does not work out your number.",null,B.a2b,null)
B.a14=s(["2:183"],t.s)
B.IJ=new A.eV("fast","Fasting in Ramadan","Able adults fast from before Fajr until Maghrib in Ramadan. This mosque announces the first day after the moon. If a website disagrees, follow this mosque.",null,B.a14,null)
